 "variants": [
  {
   "id": 0,
   "parent": null,
   "text": "The municipal swimming pool will stay closed this summer because a routine water test found a problem.",
   "author": null,
   "step": 0,
   "mutation": "original",
   "emotion": 0.04,
   "extremity": 0.98
  },
  {
   "id": 1,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "The municipal pool is being shut down indefinitely because the water is officially considered a toxic health hazard. I knew their complete lack of maintenance would finally lead to a total disaster like this.",
   "author": 59,
   "step": 1,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 1.94,
   "extremity": 3.22
  },
  {
   "id": 2,
   "parent": 0,
   "text": "I heard a rumor that the municipal pool might stay closed this summer due to a water issue, though I’m not sure how much truth there is to it since the staff usually keeps things running well.",
   "author": 44,
   "step": 2,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.29,
   "extremity": 0.1
  },
  {
   "id": 3,
   "parent": 2,
   "text": "The municipal pool is definitely not opening this summer because of a massive, catastrophic water failure. It’s official—the entire system has completely collapsed and we’re all going to be stuck without a place to swim!",
   "author": 35,
   "step": 3,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.94,
   "extremity": 3.9899999999999998
  },
  {
   "id": 4,
   "parent": 3,
   "text": "I knew it! The entire pool infrastructure has finally imploded beyond repair, and it’s officially confirmed that the facility is permanently condemned for the foreseeable future.",
   "author": 45,
   "step": 5,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.585858585858586,
   "extremity": 4.0
  },
  {
   "id": 5,
   "parent": 4,
   "text": "I’ve been hearing some talk that the pool might be in worse shape than we thought and could potentially be closed for a while. It’s hard to know what’s true, but it sounds like there might be some serious issues with the infrastructure.",
   "author": 53,
   "step": 6,
   "mutation": "soften",
   "emotion": 0.86,
   "extremity": 0.63
  },
  {
   "id": 6,
   "parent": 5,
   "text": "I’m hearing that the pool is facing a total structural collapse and will definitely be shut down for the entire season. It sounds like the damage is absolutely catastrophic and far worse than management is letting on.",
   "author": 61,
   "step": 7,
   "mutation": "exaggerate",
   "emotion": 3.94,
   "extremity": 3.9899999999999998
  }
 ],
